WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
I have to behave

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:03,120
Just in case you accidentally make him angry

3
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:05,720
What should I do if I wave my hand and feed my bones?

4
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:06,880
Not bad, not bad

5
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:09,120
You're quite sensible, don't worry

6
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:10,280
Entered my neighborhood

7
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:11,600
No one can hurt you in the future

8
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,120
Now the world has changed

9
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:14,640
There are dangers everywhere

10
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,640
If only I could live in this human community

11
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:18,000
Not a bad thing

12
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,880
Good, good boss

13
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:22,480
I just don’t know how to live in our community.

14
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:25,360
What are the conditions? It’s very simple. Look.

15
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:28,000
The monthly rent is only three million.

16
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,960
All you have to do is listen to my instructions

17
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,640
Cleaning every day

18
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,240
In addition, irregular times every month

19
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:34,440
Pay me some protection money
